5,1,1,talk,Shion,,I checked the wall. It’s thin plasterboard. Sound travels easily.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, I didn’t mean to interrupt. I just want to see the actual costs before we decide anything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I think we should look at who actually uses the room the most, so we don’t just guess!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We work so close, yet we are strangers. I want to know where our difficult conversations have been lost.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to trace where the hours go. Who is actually doing the upkeep and walking about?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the wall is the problem. Sound leaks out. We need to address that before anything else.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I understand the noise issue, but I still need the financial figures to see if we can afford the fix.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I think we should check the tally of who uses it! That will show us who is doing the walking about.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the tally shows usage, but it misses the human cost. I want to know where our last difficult conversation actually took place.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the tally is a start, but I need to see the facilities callouts to understand the hidden maintenance burden.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, callouts are just repairs. I need the tally to prove the noise complaints come from specific people, not the room itself.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I hear you, but I still need the invoices to see what we are already paying out.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I agree! We need the invoices to see the real costs. I’ll check the tally to see who uses it most.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the invoices show money, but I need to know where the last awkward conversation happened to understand our isolation.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the invoices show past spending, but I need the facilities callouts to see the hidden labor costs we are ignoring.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, I will look into the partition wall and the tally. Please check the invoices and the quotes for the fit-outs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
