35,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The wall is useless. I can hear every word from my desk. The tally confirms the two nearest to the door use it constantly.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the invoices. We paid 68,000 yen last year for nine bookings. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 and 96,000 yen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: The tally shows the two nearest to the door used it eleven times! Also, three keyboards have crumbs under the keys.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The last difficult talk happened across the desks, in front of everyone. Since the refit, unplanned talk only happens by the printer.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Eleven callouts for equipment rooms, zero for the empty store. The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. We are paying for time we do not have.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Daisuke, your quotes are high. But the wall proves the room is unusable for privacy. We must fix the sound first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the quotes are high, but the invoices show we are already bleeding money. We need to see if the fit-out is cheaper than the ongoing hire.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, twenty-five minutes is forever! If we eat here, we save that time. But the crumbs prove we need a proper kitchen, not just a table.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, saving time is good, but if we eat here, we just move the mess. I worry about the human cost of that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, twenty-five minutes is a leak. But eleven callouts show the equipment eats hours too. We are trading one drain for another.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the 141,000 yen quote is for a screen. That does not stop sound. I need the wall fixed, not just a table.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the quotes don’t cover wall repairs. I need to know if we can afford the fit-out before we discuss soundproofing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, but the crumbs are already everywhere! If we don’t have a proper place to eat, the mess just spreads to our desks.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the mess is a symptom, not the cure. If we eat here, we still lack a place to speak without fear of being overheard.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, the wall is a leak, but the lunch trip is a daily drain. We need to stop the bleeding before we build new rooms.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the wall is the root cause. If we cannot hear each other, no fit-out matters. I need that fixed before we spend more.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I hear you, but the quotes don’t cover wall repairs. I need to know if we can afford the fit-out before we discuss soundproofing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, but if we eat here, we stop the mess spreading! A proper kitchen means no crumbs on keyboards, just a clean room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a clean room is not a safe one. If the wall leaks, your kitchen becomes a public stage.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, the wall is a leak, but the lunch trip is a daily drain. We need to stop the bleeding before we build new rooms.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
